{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:AxB_ArtIII_12","page_type":"section"},"citation":"AxB Art. III § 12","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtIII_12","content_hash":"d89427c7691936434480103dc31115fd42942080fe5b36558ab737433a95fdeb","heading":"SECTION 12. POINT OF CONTACT AND NOTICES.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-iii-12:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/AxB_ArtIII_12","text":"Grantee shall at all times maintain with the City a point of contact who shall be available to act on behalf of Grantee in the event of an emergency. Grantee shall provide the City with said contact’s name, address, telephone number, fax number and e-mail address. All other notices between the parties shall be in writing and shall be made by personal delivery, depositing such notice in the U.S. Mail, First Class Postage Prepaid, Certified Mail, return receipt requested; or overnight delivery by a nationally recognized courier. All written notices shall be deemed delivered upon actual receipt or refusal of delivery.\nThe City:\nThe City of Topeka 215 SE 7th Ave Topeka, Kansas 66603 Attn: City Clerk\nGrantee:\nOffice of the President Southwestern Bell Telephone Company d/b/a AT&T Kansas 220 SE 6th St. Topeka, KS. 66603\nThe City:\nThe City of Topeka\n215 SE 7th Ave\nTopeka, Kansas 66603\nAttn: City Clerk\nGrantee:\nOffice of the President\nSouthwestern Bell Telephone Company\nd/b/a AT&T Kansas\n220 SE 6th St.\nTopeka, KS. 66603\nor to replacement addresses that may be later designated in writing. (Ord. 20252 § 12, 8-11-20.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"5f59dc69-6cca-58d0-86a0-1fe1458bd4e5"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"AxB Art. III § 12","ci